# Sprite Assets Directory

Place your 32×32 character and monster sprite PNG files here.

Expected files:

Characters:
- barbarian.png
- warrior.png
- rogue.png
- ranger.png
- mage.png
- cleric.png

Monsters:
- goblin.png
- wolf.png
- skeleton.png
- orc.png
- spider.png
- dragon.png
- zombie.png

See ../ASSETS_README.md for details.
